The prototype consists of five major layers:

1. Mechanical Layer
Pintle valve body
Pintle/needle
Linear guide mechanism
Lead screw
Actuator
Sealing elements
Flow tubing and fittings

2. Sensing Layer
Flow sensor
Upstream pressure sensor
Downstream pressure sensor
Optional temperature sensor
Optional vibration/acoustic sensing for future research

3. Control Layer
ESP32 or equivalent microcontroller
PID/feedback control
Actuator control
Throttle-position management
Emergency-stop logic

4. Data Layer

The system can record:

Timestamp
Target throttle
Actual flow
Pintle position
Upstream pressure (P1)
Downstream pressure (P2)
Differential pressure (ΔP)
Risk indicator
System status

5. Visualization Layer

A web-based dashboard is used to display:

Target vs. actual flow
Pintle position
Pressure measurements
Differential pressure
Cavitation-risk indicator
System health
Live system status
Experimental data
